window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Viewing Room Rules: </p> <p>The rules of Society X are simple...break them and you're out. </p> <p>Rule #1 - no names. It doesn't matter if you want to know; it's forbidden. </p> <p>Rule #2 - no exchanging numbers. It doesn't matter if you want to call; it's forbidden. </p> <p>Rule #3 - everything is to remain strictly anonymous. It doesn't matter if you want to tell; it's forbidden. </p> <p>Whatever your desire. Whatever your fantasy. The Viewing Room will make it happen. </p> <p>For Kennedy Vaughn it's an escape. For Hunter Miles entering the Viewing Room means he's been selected. </p> <p>What you witness in the viewing room will have you asking for more. </p>"; 
